{
  "info": {
    "name": "RevRescue API",
    "description": "Complete API collection for the RevRescue Voice Concierge Engine — all endpoints including v1 routes, auth, analytics, exports, API keys, and webhooks.\n\n**Base URL:** http://localhost:3001\n**API Docs:** http://localhost:3001/api/docs\n**WebSocket:** ws://localhost:3001/ws/dashboard\n\n## Authentication\n- **JWT:** Login at POST /auth/login → use Bearer token\n- **API Key:** X-API-Key header (for programmatic access)\n\n## Rate Limiting\n- 200 requests/minute per IP\n- X-RateLimit-* headers included\n\n## Idempotency\n- POST endpoints support Idempotency-Key header\n- Duplicate keys return cached response\n\n## Deprecation\n- v1 routes include Sunset: 2027-01-01 header",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3001",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3001/api/v1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "jwtToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiKey",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔐 Authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@revrescue.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "refresh"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🔑 API Keys",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Generate API Key",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{jwtToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Flutter App\",\n  \"scopes\": [\"read\", \"write\"],\n  \"expiresAt\": \"2027-12-31T23:59:59Z\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/api-keys",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "api-keys"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List API Keys",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{jwtToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/api-keys",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "api-keys"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Validate API Key",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"key\": \"{{apiKey}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/api-keys/validate",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "api-keys", "validate"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Revoke API Key",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{jwtToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/api-keys/KEY_ID_HERE",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "api-keys", "KEY_ID_HERE"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
